# addAllLast!

- _addAllLast!(p, q)_

Add all the elements of the sequence _q_ to the end of the sequence _p_.
Answer _q_.

```
>>> let x = [1 2 3];
>>> let y = x.addAllLast!([4 5]);
>>> (x, y)
([1 2 3 4 5], [4 5])
```

* * *

See also: add, addAll, addAllFirst

